<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοῖζ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, 
			Ion.
		
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>whistling</i> or <i>whizzing</i> of an arrow, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.361
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				19.3
			</span></i>, etc.; of a scourge, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				2.352
			</span></i>: any <i>whistling</i> or <i>piping sound</i>, as of a
			shepherd, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλῇ ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.315
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνευμάτων ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.18c
			</span></i>; <i>rush</i> of wings, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				5.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				2.26
			</span></i>; of a stream, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				47.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				17.17
			</span></i>; of the sea, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hymn.Is.</u>
				150
			</span></i>; of the <i>noise</i> of a falling tree, <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				1.251
			</span></i>; <i>hissing</i> of a serpent, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.138
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1543
			</span></i>; used of the sound made by filing, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Aud.</u>
				802a39
			</span></i>; of the letter <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ρ</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.Herc.</u>
				994.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.102
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rushing motion, rush, swing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Marc.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Demetr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, Epic. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Arch.Pap.</u>
				7p.4
			</span></i>.</div>
